window.products.push({"id":529165,"name":"Baeymonkay Curtain Holdbacks, 2 Pack Beige Rope Tiebacks for Drapes, Decorative Wall-Mounted Hardware for Easy and Damage-Free Installation, Perfect f","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":9.49,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61VRDSbaGeL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Easy Installation】Looking for an easy-to-use and sturdy solution to hold your curtains back without damaging your walls? Look no further than our Baeymonkay Window Treatment Hardware. Made with high-quality cotton yarn, our rope tiebacks come in four beautiful colors: sandy brown, black, white, and beige. Featuring a single ball design with a diameter of approximately 2.6 inches, similar in size to a baseball, you can choose the perfect one to complement your decor. 【Tool-Free and Versatile Use】One of the best things about our tiebacks is that they are tool-free to install. Simply fix the rope loops around your curtains and adjust the tightness to your liking. They can even be used for thick blackout curtains, shower curtains, tulle curtains, or as towel ties. 【Adjustable and Stylish Curtain Tiebacks】The rope's thickness is slightly thicker than a signature pen, as shown in picture 6. Measuring 24.4 inches in length, our tiebacks are adjustable, holding curtains securely in place and preventing them from slipping or sliding. They provide a beautiful touch to any medium-thick curtain. 【Perfect for Outdoor Use】Our window treatment hardware is also perfect for outdoor use, as the high-quality cotton yarn material is durable and can withstand rain, wind, and humidity without leaving any marks on your curtains. Plus, they won't emit any unpleasant odors as long as you clean and dry them after getting wet. 【Durable Curtain Holdbacks for Beachfront Homes】The Baeymonkay Window Treatment Hardware is making it perfect for those looking for a hassle-free solution to hold back their curtains. It is also sturdy and durable, making it ideal for outdoor use, such as securing patio curtains to posts. For those living by the coast, our tiebacks are made from high-quality cotton yarn, this feature makes them ideal for use in beachfront homes where salt air can damage metal and screws. 【Stylish and Functional Design】We take pride in our simple yet classic design, which not only complements coastal decor but also adds a touch of bohemian flair. Don't settle for traditional curtain tiebacks when you can add a touch of style and function with our curtain straps. Whether you're going for a coastal theme, American country style, or Nordic simplicity, our Baeymonkay Window Treatment Hardware's simple and classic design makes it a perfect addition to any decor. 【Convenience and Beauty】Order now and enjoy the convenience and beauty of our Baeymonkay Window Treatment Hardware!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61VRDSbaGeL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Baeymonkay","source_asin":"B0BR98SWMQ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-529165","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BR98SWMQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BR98SWMQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":529166,"name":"Pioneer Woman Mini Casserole with Lid (14.4 of, Teal)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":23.5,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61lycjqXr0L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The Pioneer Woman Dazzling Dahlias Mini Casserole with its own lid is a vibrantly colored, functional addition to any home. The mini casserole is great for cooking up a savory or sweet treat and are designed with handles to easily go from oven or refirgerator to table. The size is perfect for serving individual portions, whether you are having an outdoor gathering or serving up a hearty indoor meal. The Pioneer Woman mini casserole offers the durability of a stoneware construction and is both dishwasher and microwave safe. Mix and match the casseroles to add to your Pioneer Woman kitchen.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61lycjqXr0L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"The Pioneer Woman","source_asin":"B07KPNL586","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-529166","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07KPNL586","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07KPNL586","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
