window.products.push({"id":529198,"name":"2 PCS Semi-Sheer Curtains 96 Inches Long Abstract Flowing Marble Grey Gold Line - Rod Pocket Voile Living Room Curtains Panels, Window Drape Chiffon F","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":54.21,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81ZV3y8Ty5S._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"ZOE GARDEN Is Main To Bring Make Unique Home DÉcor And Quality Life For You. These Beautiful And Airy Translucent Curtain Panels Are Not Cheap In Appearance, But The Effect Is Very Rich. Great For Filtering Sunlight And Creating An Amazing Atmosphere In Your Room. Great Choice For Anyone Who Looking For A Simple And Elegant Room Appearance. Design Blends Easily With Any Home Decor. Q: Any Questions About Us? Q: Are There Any Visible Tags On The Curtains? A: No, For An Overall Appearance, There Are No Visible Labels On The Curtain Drapes. You Can Freshen Up Any Room With This Attractive Window Treatment, Offer You A Customized, Clean, And Modern Style Sure To Transform Your Room From Drab To Fab In One Fell Swoop. Q: Are These Real Sheer, Semi-Sheer Or Blackout Drape Curtain? A: Our Window Curtain Is Semi-Sheer Curtain, Not Transparent Sheer Curtain, Just Block Out Enough Sunlight So That Natural Sunlight Can Be Into, While Provide You With Privacy In The Rooms You Wish To Dress Up. A Beautiful Window Decor. Q: Are The Dimensions Of The Curtains Correct? A: Generally Speaking, The Size Of Curtains Is Standard. But Because Our Curtains Are Cut By Hand, There May Be An Error Of 0.8-1.6 Inches. Q: Is The Window Covering Durable? A: Fully Stitched And Hemmed On Edges Is Lasting-Using, While Allow The Panels To Drape Beautifully Over Your Windows. A Perfect Handcrafts! Q: Do Zoe Garden Stores Provide Customized Services? A: Yes, We Provide High-End Custom, Patterns Are Designed By Our Professional Designer, Available In Optional Sizes & Diverse Pattern, Meet Your Different Needs. Please Note 2.Due To The Display, There Will Be Little Chromatic Aberration","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81ZV3y8Ty5S._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ZOE GARDEN","source_asin":"B09TNPXKL5","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-529198","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09TNPXKL5","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09TNPXKL5","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
