window.products.push({"id":529207,"name":"Lake Havasu, California & Arizona Map Giclee Art Print Poster from Illustration by Lakebound 12\" x 18\"","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":21.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61gQhIwxPIL._AC_SL1234_.jpg","description":"This work of art is by the artists at Lakebound. Many people have strong and lasting memories of fun holidays and vacations at the lake or on the coast. Summers learning to water ski, swim, sleep-away camp, cliff jumping, time at the cabin, the smell of shady coves and bays, the lazy days melting into warm evenings, and fall after the crowds leave. There is something about the being on the water that is like nowhere else. Lakebound classic vintage maps are geographically accurate and bring a little lake or coastal magic to you and the walls of your home or office. Art print posters are from an original work of art created by an award-winning artist. They are professionally printed at our facilities in the United States on the highest quality art paper using premium, long-lasting art inks that generate intense, rich colors that are true to the artist’s vision and original creation. The time and care put into producing your art poster will make it a tremendous addition of your kitchen, bedroom, family room, office, or even dorm room wall décor.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61gQhIwxPIL._AC_SL1234_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Art of Place","source_asin":"B079NPSC42","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-529207","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B079NPSC42","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B079NPSC42","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
