window.products.push({"id":529279,"name":"Cobnom Dusty Blue/Light Blue Reversible Bed Comforter Twin Size, All Season Down Alternative Duvet - Ultra-Soft Cloud Breathable Eucalyptus Mixed Micr","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71WiNeUQVmL._AC_SL1080_.jpg","description":"ULTIMATE SOFT & COMFORTABLE - The Dusty Blue/Light Blue Reversible comforter is covered in custom-designed polyester fabric with double brushed & pre-washed, that's softer than cotton, filled with just right amount of blend microfiber, our twin size down alternative comforter is super soft, breathable, plush, skin-friendly, lightweight but warm for a restful sleeping experience. Perfect for kids, teens and adults. DRESS YOUR BED - Value sale buy 1 down alternative comforter and get 2 matching pillow shams FREE! 1pc TWIN bed comforter size: 68”x90”, 1pc shams size: 20”x30”. Filled with 270gsm (~34oz) mixed microfiber, the TWIN size all-season comforter is constructed for most people year-round comfort - stays cool during the summer and keeping warm on a cold winter night. Choose your reversible comforter set with trend colors (such as white, yellow/gray, moss green/tan, Dusty blue/Light blue, etc). WAKE UP REFRESHED - Our unique high-tech processed polyester & Eucalyptus Lyocell blend fiberfill allows microfiber to quickly absorb sweat and keeps dry. It's a result that enables the alternative down duvet to perform well on breathability and temperature control to keep you cooling, dry, and warm every night. Our plush comforter set twin also is Noise-Free and Odorless, make you refresh every morning. LIKE SLEEP IN A CLOUD - Fluffy and lightweight like a cloud, whole-piece quilted for well-distributed, won't press you when sleeping under the cloud comforter. The end-to-end sewn-through box stitching looks elegant while also keep the fill secure to prevent it from shifting or clumping without cold spots, ensuring a restful sleeping experience all night long. EASY USE & CARE - Machine washable and dryable. Please air and re-fluffed the quilt at first-time use. It can be used as a stand-alone comforter, or as a duvet insert with a favorite cover, or as a bed blanket. Great gift for family & friends. If our twin size microfiber comforter set is not what you want or it has some defects, just contact us via email to get a partial/full refund or a new one.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71WiNeUQVmL._AC_SL1080_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Cobnom","source_asin":"B086ZY6YB3","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-529279","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B086ZY6YB3","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B086ZY6YB3","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
