window.products.push({"id":529525,"name":"Rev-A-Shelf SBDT-2730-A-1 Under Sink Base Drip Tray Mat Shelf Liner for Kitchen Cabinets Protective Organization Accessory, Almond","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":42.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71RXTjVzo7L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"PROTECT YOUR CABINETS: Maximize space and protect your under-sink cabinet from damage with this sink base drip tray; Trays are easy to clean up and resistant to most household chemicals DURABILITY & ELEGANCE: Made from strong molded plastic material for durability that is very rigid and does not fold or bend UNIQUE DESIGN: Unique design not only protects the bottom of your cabinet by holding water the tray funnels excessive water to the front of your cabinet and out onto the floor alerting you of the leak INSTALLATION: Using a standard utility knife, you can trim the tray to a custom fit; Unit can be installed to an existing cabinet but may require extensive modification to fit around existing plumbing; Product is very rigid and may have difficulty getting into existing cabinets where a center divider exists; Minimum trim size is 25-1/2\" W x 21-1/2\" D DIMENSIONS (W x D x H): 28.5\"W x 23.25\"D x 0.75\"H; Liquid capacity of 1.46 quarts and is recommended for a 27-inch and 30-inch sink base kitchen cabinet; Recommended to measure cabinet before purchasing","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71RXTjVzo7L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Rev-A-Shelf","source_asin":"B012A8O0H8","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-529525","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B012A8O0H8","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B012A8O0H8","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":529526,"name":"Bodum Chambord 3 Cup Shatterproof French Press Coffeemaker","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71YbsOlKfdL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The CHAMBORD Coffeemaker is the Original French Press. When Bodum took over a small clarinet factory in Normandy in 1982, it was not because of the fine orchestra clarinets they were producing but because of a relatively unknown coffee maker called the Chambord which they produced as well. The reason the French press coffeemaker has become one of the most popular coffeemakers in the world is pure and simple- taste. The materials are completely taste-free so nothing comes between your ground coffee beans. This is exactly the reason why coffee tasters use this method to determine the quality of coffee beans. The 3-part stainless steel plunger has a fine mesh filter, which allows for a premium extraction of your coffee’s aromatic oils and subtle flavors. A mesh filter allows this flavor to be delivered direct to your cup and not absorbed by a paper filter. Plus, no paper filter means no waste! The patented safety lid prevents the splashing of liquids while pressing. Simplicity works best and is the reason why the Chambord’s design has not changed a bit from its original drawing. This 3-cup model (0.35 l, 12 oz.) features a BPA-free, SAN plastic carafe which is shatter-resistant. Also available in 4 cup (0.6 l, 17 oz.), 8 cup (1.0, 34 oz.) and 12 cup (1.5 l, 51 oz.) size models.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71YbsOlKfdL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Bodum","source_asin":"B07FKPGZ8K","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-529526","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07FKPGZ8K","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07FKPGZ8K","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":529527,"name":"BOFENG Round End Coffee Tables Accent Sofa Side Tables Living Room Tea Table with Steel Metal Frame Legs Small Study Desk for Bedroom Balcony Office K","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71lKlUEvkfL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"✽ Time is the best teacher:BOFENG Home Furnishing, founded in 1994, has been deeply involved in the industry for more than 20 years. We have a mature technology and professional team.We have been committed to providing consumers with high-quality products and comfortable experience, and sincerely treat every customer's expectations. ✽ Top professional home furnishing manufacturer: specializing in the production of metal bed frames, clothing racks, towel racks, tables and other series of products, with a complete quality management system, strict control of every detail from production to packaging, until the design of high-quality target products. ✽ Worry-free after-sales service: BOFENG brand products enjoy a one-year warranty service. We have a complete after-sales service system. If you have any questions, please feel free to contact us, we promise to provide you with a satisfactory solution. Feature: √ The table is made of high-grade MDF wood + the legs of the table are made of heavy-duty steel metal + high-quality powder coating to ensure the robustness, stability and durability of the product. √ The circular appearance creates a relaxing atmosphere for your room, which can be used as a dining table, coffee table, living room reading table, bedside table, bedroom sofa, etc. √ The round metal legs are more textured and can prevent scratches. The legs intersect to form a solid angle, so that the table does not shake and is more stable. √ The combination of wooden table top and steel metal frame exudes the classic atmosphere of retro style. Simple, generous and practical, it is a beautiful scenery in your room. √ The sturdy and stable outer box ensures that the product will not be damaged when it arrives. Packaged includes : ■ table ■ Assemble Manual ■ Screws + Allen Key","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71lKlUEvkfL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"BOFENG","source_asin":"B09KSYWTK1","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-529527","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09KSYWTK1","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09KSYWTK1","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":529528,"name":"ChalkTalkSPORTS Volleyball Premium Beach Towel | Volleyball Heart","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41WceJgzXQL._AC_.jpg","description":"RELAX WITH YOUR FAVORITE VOLLEYBALL TOWEL! Show off your passion for volleyball at the beach, swimming pool or any of your spring and summer activities with our great selection of volleyball beach towels! Whether your sunbathing in your yard or having a picnic in the park, our stylish volleyball towels are perfect for you! Makes a great volleyball coach, volleyball player, fan, or team gift as well! PREMIUM TOWEL! This 60\" X 30\" beach towel is made from super soft and silky polyester on the design side and 100% super absorbent cotton on the reverse side, our beach towels are super soft, comfortable, and practical. Drying extremely quickly, our towels are perfect when you need to dry off multiple times throughout the day. They are the perfect size to fold up compactly for ease of carrying from location to location. Machine wash and tumble dry to use this towel over and over. CHOOSE FROM A VARIETY OF UNIQUE DESIGNS! Our beach towels come in a wide variety of designs and colors! Perfect for fans, coaches, and athletes during your next event! Whether you’re a spectator on a hot bench, a fan in the stands, or an athlete wiping off the sweat, our beach towels are the perfect solution to all your needs! SIZE: Beach towels are traditionally longer than bath towels to accommodate lying back and relaxing, while preventing contact with hot surfaces. EASY CARE & LONG LASTING: 100% Cotton, breathable, comfortable and fade-resistant premium weight towel. Each beach towel is fade resistant and stays soft through many washes to withstand all your many sport outings and beach days to come. DESIGNED AND SOLD BY ChalkTalk SPORTS - A USA based, family operated business located in Connecticut. We pride ourselves on the integrity and quality of our products and firmly stand behind all that we sell. If you are not 100% satisfied with your purchase, please contact us so we can make it right.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41WceJgzXQL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ChalkTalkSPORTS","source_asin":"B09BK2F6SC","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-529528","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09BK2F6SC","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09BK2F6SC","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
