window.products.push({"id":529774,"name":"FoodSaver Essential Series V375 Vacuum Sealing Kit, White","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31Nw6+CV9ZL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Product Description The Foodsaver Vac 375 locks out air and moisture and seals in freshness to prevent freezer burn, keeping food fresh longer. Its hands-free operation and easy-clean drop tray make the system simple to use. Includes extra bags and roll (11W\"x18L') for custom-size bags, store-n-cut roll holder and cutter plus an accessory mode for canisters. 2-3/4Hx5-1/2Wx17L\". Imported. Amazon.com FoodSaver vacuum packaging systems have so many practical applications, it's hard to imagine who couldn't benefit from owning one. The FoodSaver's main usage is for food freshness as it seals food for refrigerator or freezer storage while drawing out air and moisture, which can cause food to spoil sooner. The result is food that stays fresher five times longer than if it were kept in average storage canisters or plastic wrap, that prevents freezer burn, and remains flavorful and nutritious. This system is economical for families who prefer to buy in bulk as it keeps seasonal foods from degrading before they can be eaten. The FoodSaver also is a time-saver as it allows cooks to make up large quantities of a recipe ahead of time and then freeze individual meals for fast dinners on busy days, brown bag lunches for school or work, or.pre-weighed portions for special diets. Cooks can even prep and seal food for a party to keep ingredients, such as potatoes or apples, from coloring before serving time. The FoodSaver storage bags are conveniently safe for boiling or the microwave to make reheating a cinch. Other helpful uses include sealing emergency kit contents or boating or camping gear to keep them dry in wet conditions, making ice packs, or keeping polished silver from tarnishing. This FoodSaver kit comes with three quart-sized and two gallon-sized bags plus a roll of 11-inch-by-10-foot plastic wrap and a roll holder and cutter for custom cutting any bag size. Bags have channels that make air removal more efficient and a 5-ply construction that offers a better barrier against moisture and oxygen than freezer bags. This Essential Series FoodSaver appliance is designed to fit any FoodSaver bag size and offers hands-free operation so users simply press the lid once and the appliance vacuums, seals, and turns off automatically. The commercial-quality vacuum pump extracts air quickly and a Teflon-coated sealing strip holds bags evenly for an airtight seal. The patented vacuum channel keeps liquids from overflowing into the appliance and sends them instead into a removable drip tray, which is dishwasher-safe for easy cleaning. The V375 also comes with an accessory hose that hooks into a port on the main appliance to vacuum package with compatible FoodSaver canisters, bottle stoppers, and lids (all sold separately). An accessory mode on the vacuum adjusts the amount of air removal to the appropriate amount for each type of container. Tilia includes a reference guide, a quick-start guide, and an instructional video to get novices started and offers a one-year warranty on this amazing product. --Cristina Vaamonde","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31Nw6+CV9ZL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"FOODSAVER","source_asin":"B00025B5XY","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-529774","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00025B5XY","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00025B5XY","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
