window.products.push({"id":529840,"name":"VirFLO Oil Sprayer for Cooking, Olive Oil Sprayer Mister,200ml Olive Oil Spray Bottle, kitchen Gadgets Accessories for Air Fryer,Canola Oil Spritzer, ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":7.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/616NnlMZ7JL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Multi-Purpose:It is reusable kitchenware tools for home and kitchen. Fill this sprayer with all kinds of seasoning, such as olive oil, vinegar, soy sauce, lemon and lime juice, sherry or wine. And widely used during salad making, Cooking,Baking, Roasting, Grilling, Frying, BBQ and so on. Friendly Ergonomic Handle: The smart design of transparent durable material, the oil dispenser is convenient to know the status and the amount of oil, easy to recognize the seasoning(oil/vinegar/sauce) quickly. The friendly ergonomically designed non-slip push handle makes it easier to use. Tip: The best way to spray is hold the sprayer with 45 degree. If the bottom of the straw is not in the same direction as the nozzle, please pull out the straw and adjust it in the same direction.Different way different effect, press to the end and press quickly you will get a foggy effect, halfway down will get a columnar effect. (Note: The mist effect will be affected by the distance and consistency of the liquids you fill.) Not Broken & Easy To Clean: Different from other fragile glass oil bottles, they are solid and tough, don't worry about breaking. Just pour some warm water and detergent into the bottle then tighten the lid, give it a shake. You will get nearly a new bottle after repeat 2-5 times! Note: the water temperature cannot be higher than 122°F/50°C, cannot be washed with a dishwasher. Sealing & Large Opening: The large opening of the spray olive oil bottle makes the kitchen oil sprayer bottle easy to fill without a funnel, and the specially designed lock-sealed bottle is tightly sealed to prevent leakage. Don’t need to worry about the olive oil leaking or getting dirty, just use the oil sprayer with peace of mind.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/616NnlMZ7JL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"VirFLO","source_asin":"B09C7ZCZ63","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-529840","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09C7ZCZ63","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09C7ZCZ63","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
